                  "mapping_justification": "The Orphanet-derived class (Orphanet:308442) for the isolated methylmalonic aciduria form, curated here as the cblD-MMA subtype. MONDO also carries an OMIM-derived class for the same form, MONDO:0700298 (OMIM:620953), which is that subtype's binding; the two are not linked in MONDO.",
                  "mapping_predicate": "skos:narrowMatch",
